{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Is this business about the security footage related, by any chance?": "",
  "W-Who could say...?": "",
  "You can, and judging by the way you're panicking, I'd say that footage has some incriminating evidence on you.": "",
  "Grgh...": "",
  "Oikawa told you to make sure it got deleted, but the deal with this old man started falling through.": "",
  "That about the sum of things?": "",
  "Sh-Shut up! If you're gonna get in my way, I'll kill you!": "",
  "Gahhh...": "",
  "Hey. You said you hadn't deleted the footage yet, right?": "",
  "Heh, that's right. I figured it would be worth a nice chunk of change, and I was right.": "",
  "Fine. Let me buy it off you then.": "",
  "Huh!? You mean it? How much you offering?": "",
  "Depends on the content. If what I need is on there, I'll pay you the full 100k.": "",
  "Oh, then we have a deal! Lemme get it for ya!": "",
  "The coast is clear?": "",
  "We're fine. I want to see about ten minutes of footage from 8:27 PM. You have that?": "",
  "Yeah, it's all here. Hmm...": "",
  "And the timestamps line up... So how does a shot taken at the same time seem to have two different women?": "",
  "Was the photo digitally altered? If the woman wore the same clothes, they'd just need to swap out her face...": "",
  "Yeah, this is pretty clear proof that Oikawa is using dirty evidence!": "",
  "Grahhhh!": "",
  "Ha!": "",
  "Damn it...! I think the hard drive is toast!": "",
  "That's what you get for fucking with me, old man!": "",
  "There are no copies, right!? If I find out you copied this, I really will kill you!": "",
  "N-N-No, that was the only copy!": "",
  "Ha... Looks like I win. That tape'll never see the light of day!": "",
  "Damn you, Oikawa...": "",
  "Yagami! Anything to report?": "",
  "The photo of your client going into the hotel with that man... It was fabricated.": "",
  "W-What!? Oikawa, you...": "",
  "...I won't take these baseless accusations lying down. Do you have any proof?": "",
  "...No. The PC it was on got destroyed. <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Someone</font_kind> went to some pretty extreme measures to eliminate it.": "",
  "Hmph. Then this isn't even worth discussing.": "",
  "Oikawa... Did you bring this photo here in advance of the trial because you were afraid it could be proven false?": "",
  "Haha... Please. Listen to yourself.": "",
  "Paired with your client's... hazy memory, this photo is both valid and decisive.": "",
  "And no judge in his right mind would take your client's side with photo evidence like this in my hands.": "",
  "Grr...": "",
  "So, Otaki-san, what will it be? Pay for damages as well as let this photo drag you through the mud in court?": "",
  "Otaki-san, please, you need to consider this carefully!": "",
  "There's no way I can win, right?": "",
  "If I'm going to get hit with \"damages\" and become a tabloid laughing-stock, I'd rather just sign the paperwork now!": "",
  "Ma'am! Let's not be rash! We should at least discuss your options first!": "",
  "Enough, Genda-sensei. I've had enough. In the end, you couldn't help me.": "",
  "I've already made up my mind.": "",
  "Hah... And now my client will have full custody. Looks like I win, Genda-sensei!": "",
  "Ha... Hahaha! I've finally beaten you!": "",
  "Put whatever you want on the stupid paper.": "",
  "I'm gonna move out on my own. You two can fight all you want.": "",
  "Karin, you'll do no such thing. Don't you want to live with your father?": "",
  "You think they've even considered their daughter's feelings in this, Yagami-san?": "",
  "If she ran out with the kid, what I'm saying is, do you think they've even discussed her wishes before hiring lawyers?": "",
  "Well, she's old enough for her opinion to matter...": "",
  "Actually, I think I know exactly how she feels.": "",
  "After Oikawa busted in, I didn't have any time to bring this up...": "",
  "But I have evidence that I think points to what Karin wants.": "",
  "What is that, Yagami?": "",
  "Karin-chan wanted her father to have this, but she ended up tearing it up instead.": "",
  "Wait, she was trying to give this to him?": "",
  "Yes. And I would bet this is a representation of how she really feels.": "",
  "Tickets... to the circus? Three of them.": "",
  "The number's significant, I think.": "",
  "...I see. Thanks, Yagami. I think there may be an amicable solution to this after all.": "",
  "Amicable, huh?": "",
  "Karin-chan... Is there something you want to say to your parents?": "",
  "I understand you were trying to give this to your father.": "",
  "There are three tickets here. This is what you really want, isn't it?": "",
  "Karin, what are you getting at?": "",
  "I think I see...": "",
  "...Y-Yeah.": "",
  "I wanted the three of us to go to the circus again.": "",
  "Again?": "",
  "Don't you remember the last time we went? You guys were so mean to each other before...": "",
  "But after we got back from the circus, you were fine. You were smiling and laughing.": "",
  "I thought maybe if we went to the circus together again, it might work the same way...": "",
  "If that was the case, why did you tear up the tickets, Karin-chan?": "",
  "You're holding back, aren't you?": "",
  "I'm...": "",
  "Karin-chan, they're the only parents you'll ever have. If you have something important to say, don't swallow it.": "",
  "Get it off your chest, young lady. Say what you're feeling.": "",
  "How I really feel?": "",
  "Yes, there's no time like the present. If you don't, you'll come to regret it eventually.": "",
  "Enough of this. We're past the point of reconciliation, I'd say.": "",
  "You're right, Mister. I have been holding something in.": "",
  "But what's the point? Even if I told you guys, you wouldn't listen, because you just wanna get divorced.": "",
  "Karin. No, we'll listen.": "",
  "I don't want to live by myself. I want the three of us to live together!": "",
  "What's so hard about that!? I don't want us to be apart!": "",
  "K-Karin...": "",
  "Knowing how your daughter feels... Are you really past the point of reconciliation?": "",
  "Have the two of you even discussed the matter since Azusa and Karin left? I imagine you haven't.": "",
  "...It's true. We haven't.": "",
  "Well, might I suggest you start there? And if you still want to file for divorce, I'll be here.": "",
  "We do need to consider our daughter in this... We've been rash.": "",
  "Y-Yeah. As parents, we owe that to her...": "",
  "That's that, then. Looks like you're dismissed, Oikawa.": "",
  "H-Hold on! Genda-sensei, you can't just abandon the fight!": "",
  "I won't accept that!": "",
  "If there's no case, you don't get paid either, you know!": "",
  "Sounds like you still don't get it, Oikawa.": "",
  "Get what!?": "",
  "Our job is to get the best result possible for our clients. We stand by them as they make life-changing decisions.": "",
  "If you're making choices based on your personal pocket book or your pride, why do you deserve clients?": "",
  "W-What are you getting at!?": "",
  "Listen. At the end of the day, if it would benefit the client...": "",
  "It's okay to lose the trial.": "",
  "Okay to lose? In what world?": "",
  "If winning the trial is all you're concerned about, you'll never be more than a mediocre lawyer at best.": "",
  "Fuck this! I'm not going to stand here and let you lecture me!": "",
  "This isn't over! Not by a long shot!": "",
  "I won't accept this!": "",
  "Good grief... You still don't get it?": "",
  "Jin-san, isn't divorce in your best interest!? She's already proven that she'll latch onto the first man she finds!": "",
  "...But her lawyer is saying that the guy was a set up.": "",
  "Hardly! Those are baseless accusations, and there's no evidence to prove it.": "",
  "And your wife simply \"doesn't remember\"? You're going to accept that?": "",
  "No one in their right mind could, right? Your feelings about your wife haven't really changed.": "",
  "Besides, do you really expect the two of you could get along just fine after this? Hardly!": "",
  "You're probably right, but, still...": "",
  "(Damn. Oikawa is stooping to preying on his insecurities. He's losing confidence in his decision...!)": "",
  "These pictures are as real as the Earth is round. You can't allow these people to cloud your path forward!": "",
  "Excuse me? Is there a Yagami-san here?": "",
  "Aha, there you are. Finally found you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hm? The receptionist from the love hotel? What are you doing here?": "",
  "Well, I looked up your office, and I didn't find you there.": "",
  "Then this yakuza-lookin' fella told me I might find you here, and here you are.": "",
  "...That's great and all, but we're kind of in the middle of something here.": "",
  "Well I have an offer for ya! Didn't you say you wanted to buy that data?": "",
  "I did, but... Wasn't the PC destroyed? You said yourself there were no other copies.": "",
  "Right... And I'd say that again if that blond asshole was here to threaten me...": "",
  "But the truth is, I did make a copy... Figured there might be a profit in it. Hehe.": "",
  "W-What!?": "",
  "Must be pretty valuable, eh? 100 g's. Ya buyin'?": "",
  "Heh heh... A pleasure doin' business...": "",
  "Genda-sensei. I need to borrow your computer. And cut me a check for 100k as a business expense, please.": "",
  "Whatever this is about better be worth the price, Yagami.": "",
  "There we go. Perfect.": "",
  "Yagami, care to fill us in?": "",
  "Do you know what this is, Oikawa-san? You worked very hard to make sure no one ever saw it.": "",
  "...C-Can it be?": "",
  "Afraid so. Evidence that you fabricated the photo.": "",
  "This is security footage from the love hotel!": "",
  "I-Impossible!": "",
  "Yagami, I think you owe us an explanation.": "",
  "As you can see in the photo, it's the same time stamp as this video. But, notice anything different about the woman?": "",
  "It's obviously impossible that he entered the hotel at the same time with two different women. Therefore...": "",
  "Oikawa's photo is bogus. It's been doctored.": "",
  "Oikawa... You'd stoop to forgery? You finally dug yourself into a hole...": "",
  "Ah, no, it's...": "",
  "What do you think would happen if this came to light in court? Why, you could lose your license to practice.": "",
  "No, it's...": "",
  "If you still want to go to trial, I'm willing, Oikawa. But it's your call.": "",
  "Sounds to me like we'd start on a custody battle and end on a malpractice trial.": "",
  "D-Damn the both of you!": "",
  "He sure left in a hurry.": "",
  "Stupid kid. So immature still.": "",
  "Dad... Mom... We don't need this anymore, right?": "",
  "Karin...": "",
  "You're right. We don't.": "",
  "Thanks, Yagami. You really saved me this time.": "",
  "Nah. It was quite an honor seeing you be the kind of lawyer I always knew you were.": "",
  "Ha, so unlike Oikawa, you get it. You know, if you ever wanna wear the badge again, I think we could make it work.": "",
  "You did some impressive work out there today.": "",
  "Tch. I did what I could do... as a detective.": "",
  "In fact, I learned something today. I don't have what it takes to be a lawyer like you, Genda-sensei. I'll pass.": "",
  "Damn. What is it about all my students that they become mediocre lawyers? Maybe it's me.": "",
  "Mediocre? You lumping me into that?": "",
  "Shintani? How long have you been back?": "",
  "Long enough.": "",
  "Looked to me like things were getting pretty rough, so I kept quiet.": "",
  "Wouldn't want to spoil the moment.": "",
  "Well, it's good timing all the same. Didn't you need Shintani for something, Yagami?": "",
  "I am. Who are you?": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san? Yes, Genda-sensei did mention you. Well, nice to meet you.": "",
  "Karin? You didn't see her?": "",
  "R-Really? She was here just a second ago. I got so focused on the clothes, I guess I didn't realize...": "",
  "Wh-What should I do?": "",
  "O-Okay.": "",
  "(The is our playboy from earlier. But what I need some clarity on is the woman with him.)": "",
  "(No good, I can't see her face from this angle.)": "",
  "(This doesn't contradict Oikawa's photo.)": "",
  "(This guy was almost certainly hired by Oikawa, but the problem is the woman next to him...)": "",
  "(No good, I can't make out her face.)": "",
  "(Tch, this guy's face annoys me. But the woman with him is what matters...)": "",
  "Ah! That woman he's with isn't Azusa-san!": "",
  "That's pretty outrageous... Can't you go any lower?": "",
  "...Guess we don't have a deal then...": "",
  "Wait, wait, wait!": "",
  "Well, ya gonna buy it or not?": "",
  "Here. What do you think?": "",
  "This is evidence? How?": "",
  "You don't get it either, Genda-sensei?": "",
  "No, not really. Care to clue me in?": "",
  "How can I explain what I don't understand myself? I figured you could tell us.": "",
  "You think this is evidence, but you're not even sure why yourself?": "",
  "Precisely, Genda-sensei. That's exactly it.": "",
  "Yagami, I should kick you right out of this office. This is no time for guessing games.": "",
  "Er... Yeah. I think I have something better to present.": "",
  "(It's probably in the Hotel District, and I can use the photo as reference.)": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san! Did you come to watch me sing?": "",
  "Of course. Gotta stay current on the latest Sana-chan hits, you know?": "",
  "Aww. That makes me feel really special.": "",
  "Then I'll put a little more <font_kind=yakuza_italic>oomph</font_kind> into my performance today, just for you! ❤": "",
  "Man, why does <font_kind=yakuza_italic>he</font_kind> get all the special treatment, huh?": "",
  "My heart... it roars with the flames of jealousy! ...Or maybe it's just my heartburn.": "",
  "Sana-chan looks so happy... Wish she'd look that way for me!": "",
  "Actually, I was just passing by. Sorry.": "",
  "Oh... okay. Have fun doing whatever you were gonna do.": "",
  "Man, this dude doesn't have a clue. Should've just said yes.": "",
  "Perhaps he's too embarrassed to publicly express his affection. His loss, I say.": "",
  "Sana-chan looks so dejected... Wish she'd look that way for me!": "",
  "Hey, did I keep you waiting?": "",
  "Not at all, I actually just got here.": "",
  "Cool. Thanks for coming on such short notice.": "",
  "Thanks for inviting me. Glad we can finally hang out.": "",
  "Hehe. Me too.": "",
  "Anywhere you want to go in particular?": "",
  "Well, since I've lived in the country my whole life, I never really got the chance to see the big city...": "",
  "Honestly, I just wanna go somewhere fun. Release all that built-up tension, you know?": "",
  "(Hmm... What would be a good idea for us?)": "",
  "How about the batting center? It's a pretty good stress reliever.": "",
  "Ooh, sounds good! I've actually never been to one.": "",
  "Perfect, then let's get going.": "",
  "You ever play darts before?": "",
  "Of course, my friends and I play all the time!": "",
  "Cool. Then why don't we head on over?": "",
  "Want to check out the arcade?": "",
  "Sure, as long as we can try out the UFO Catcher!": "",
  "Whew... I'm having a blast so far!": "",
  "Do you want to sit and catch your breath for a bit, maybe?": "",
  "That would be good... I am getting a little tired.": "",
  "Sana-chan, do you have any hobbies?": "",
  "Other than music? Well, let's see...": "",
  "I would say cooking.": "",
  "Now that's a helpful hobby. Any secret recipes you're willing to share?": "",
  "Ha, I wish. All I can really make is simple stuff like curry.": "",
  "Yeah. I used to live with my parents before I came to Tokyo, so I was always eating with them.": "",
  "Oh, what were some of your favorites?": "",
  "Ah, you know. Things like curry, stew, meat and potatoes... The basics.": "",
  "Can't go wrong with comfort food, huh?": "",
  "Exactly. And since I've been eating a lot of takeout these days, I miss that home-cooked flavor even more.": "",
  "Good, 'cause curry's one of my all-time favorites!": "",
  "I've been trying to recreate my mom's curry from scratch. You'd know why if you tried it... It's the best there is.": "",
  "How's that coming along?": "",
  "Honestly, I can't seem to get it right at all. So I decided to go off on my own little venture.": "",
  "Like using more traditional ingredients or experimenting with different spices, for example.": "",
  "Heh, sounds like someone really knows their curry.": "",
  "I can make curry, too. It's not that hard to do.": "",
  "Nah. Back when I was poor, I dedicated myself to making the most amazing curry possible using only the cheap stuff.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Ha!": "ฮา!",
  "Grr...": "กรรรร...",
  "Again?": "อีกครั้งเหรอ?",
  "I'm...": "ฉัน...",
  "O-Okay.": "โ-โอเค"
 }
}
